# SELECT_COUNTER: Anti-Spell's cost removes 2 Spell Counters from your side of the field. With two
# Breakers holding one each, the core asks which cards to take them from.
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
card 0 hand 71413901        # Breaker the Magical Warrior (gets 1 Spell Counter when Normal Summoned)
card 0 hand 71413901
card 0 hand 53112492        # Anti-Spell (Counter Trap)
card 0 hand 83764718        # Monster Reborn
card 0 grave 89631139       # Blue-Eyes White Dragon
card 0 deck 15025844 x5
card 1 deck 15025844 x5

0 idle summon 71413901
0 idle sset 53112492
0 idle end
1 idle end
0 idle summon 71413901
0 idle activate 83764718
0 select 89631139
0 chain 53112492            # negate own Monster Reborn, just to pay the counter cost
0 counter 71413901 71413901 # one counter from each Breaker
expect count 0 mzone 2      # Monster Reborn was negated: no Blue-Eyes
expect count 0 grave 3      # Blue-Eyes, Monster Reborn, Anti-Spell
stop
